cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Troponin change in sepsis — reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code (R and Python) and database extraction SQL for the study
  "Prognostic Value of Troponin Change Beyond Baseline Troponin and Clinical State
  in Sepsis: A Cohort Study with Multicentre External Validation". The repository
  contains no patient-level data; the source databases are available from PhysioNet
  under a credentialed data use agreement.
type: software
authors:
